From: Mariano Scazzariello <marianoscazzariello@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:16:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Simulator: check real KV transfer bytes with a pattern

- kv_pattern_fill: prefill writes a per-request, per-layer, per-logical-block pattern
- kv_pattern_check: decode sentinels blocks before a read and compares them when it finishes
- results as kv_check records in the step log
